<p><span>final counter value;</span></p>
</li>
<li>
<p><span>elapsed time;</span></p>
</li>
<li>
<p><span>trial number.</span></p>
</li>
</ul>
<p><span>Your analysis must discuss race conditions, critical sections, mut=
ex overhead, and correctness.</span></p>
<h3><span>Option 2 =E2=80=94 Memory Allocation and Process Memory</span></h=
3>
<p><span>Research question:</span></p>
